1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,422
Point Nemo turns your lesson PDF into a local underwater study adventure.

2
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:08,013
Start with your own notes.

3
00:00:08,013 --> 00:00:12,013
Choose one English, text-based PDF from your local library.

4
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:16,932
The safety gate checks the file and its signature before local processing

5
00:00:16,932 --> 00:00:17,285
begins.

6
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:20,725
Sonar reads your lesson.

7
00:00:20,725 --> 00:00:25,334
Local Ollama creates nine questions, then validation checks answers against

8
00:00:25,334 --> 00:00:26,317
source evidence.

9
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:29,803
Explore three topics on your ocean map.

10
00:00:29,803 --> 00:00:32,421
Clear each encounter to unlock the next.

11
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:36,023
Every correction has a source.

12
00:00:36,023 --> 00:00:40,396
Miss a question, and see the correct answer, an explanation, and the exact

13
00:00:40,396 --> 00:00:42,464
supporting quote with its PDF page.

14
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:49,002
Then face the final review: the same nine questions, shuffled.

15
00:00:49,002 --> 00:00:51,180
Get eight right to complete the run.

16
00:00:53,250 --> 00:00:55,632
See your result, and try the lesson again.

17
00:00:57,150 --> 00:00:59,782
One lesson. One descent.